@startuml
title POST /api/ai-agents/{id}/delete/prepare + /send — delete an agent (tokenless flow)
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #294C60
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF5FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #38789E
  LifeLineBorderColor #6A92AA
  GroupBackgroundColor #FFF3E8
  GroupBorderColor #D97638
}

actor "Agent owner" as Owner #FFD8C2
participant "AgentsApiSdk\n.delete(id)" as SDK #D5EAF7
participant "EmbersEvents\n(WebSocket)" as Events #E3D8F5
participant "Embers API" as API #FFC9A8
participant "AgentsService" as Domain #CDEACC
participant "F1r3node\nchain + observer" as Chain #FFE4A6

Owner -> SDK : delete(id)

group Prepare — bare contract, no token
SDK -> API : POST /api/ai-agents/{id}/delete/prepare\n(no body)
API -> Domain : prepare_delete_contract(id)
Domain -> Domain : render delete.rho(id)
Domain -> Chain : get head block index
Chain --> Domain : valid-after block number
Domain --> API : DeleteAgentResp { contract }
API --> SDK : 200 { contract }\n(no PrepareResponse wrapper, no token)
end

group Sign, subscribe, send — bare signed contract
SDK -> SDK : signed = signContract(contract, privateKey)
SDK -> Events : subscribeForDeploy(\n  hex(signed.sig).toLowerCase(), maxWait)
SDK -> API : POST /api/ai-agents/{id}/delete/send\nbody: SignedContract only
API -> Domain : deploy signed contract
Domain -> Chain : deploy
Chain --> Domain : accepted
API <-- Domain : deploy id
SDK <-- API : 200 SendResp { deploy_id }
SDK --> Owner : { prepareResponse, sendResponse,\n  waitForFinalization }
end

group Finalization — observed on the WebSocket
Chain --> Events : Finalized { deploy_id, ...,\n  node_type: Observer }
Events --> Owner : waitForFinalization resolves\n(or rejects after maxWait)
end

note over API #FFF6C9
Tokenless delete asymmetry — see the HTTP API
specification. Check which teams still use the
agent first: GET /api/ai-agents-teams/{address}/
referencing/{agent_id} names what deletion
would break.
end note
@enduml
